{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1325638-soft-armour","id":1325638,"title":"Soft Armour","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-07-18T10:11:00-07:00","id":1325638,"title":"Soft Armour","content":"So I came across this because I was trying to Investitaging how to read the Durability mega-edge.<br /> <br /> Pg. 126 Armor, Trinity Core [Bold is for emphasis]<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The first benefit is soft armour. Typically, after a character has successfully struck another, they can automatically inflict damage by purchasing the \u201cInflict Damage\u201d Stunt. Soft armour forces the attacker to spend additional successes (equal to the <b>rating of the armour</b>) to cause injury.<b> All armour provides one point of Soft armour by default.</b> </div> </div> </div>Does this mean that Armor has a rating? What is the rating? I assume the Soft Tag adds to this.<br /> <br /> This may be a case of a small overlooked rule. <br /> <br /> If this is true. The rating of the armour that the Durability mega-edge gives you is your Q/2 (round up). This means you get your rating in Soft Armor, plus 3 additional Soft Armor (1 default, +2 from Soft Armour tag). <br /> <br /> Is my thinking correct?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2018-bioagent","name":"Bioagent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2018_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T11:26:43-07:00","id":1325671,"title":"","content":"I guess you found the explanation, at least for the origin for the Armor rating.<br /> <br /> Now the question is \u00bd quantum round up has a minimum of 1, so the soft armor is going to be 2 + Q/2 (round up) or 3 + Q/2 (round up).<br /> <br /> I go for 2+Q/2","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T15:07:38-07:00","id":1325743,"title":"","content":"The Soft tag is the rating. You\u2019ll see that all armor includes \u2018Soft 1\u2019 at least. If the number is higher, that\u2019s the Soft rating, not that +1.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-18T15:19:39-07:00","id":1325746,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1325638-soft-armour?p=1325743#post1325743\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Soft tag is the rating. You\u2019ll see that all armor includes \u2018Soft 1\u2019 at least. If the number is higher, that\u2019s the Soft rating, not that +1.</div> </div> </div> </div>So the Soft Armor from Durability is 2+Q/2","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","val